{
  "version": 2,
  "description": "DesiFit x Google Flow asset manifest. Maps every gallery screen to the Flow prompts that generate its media (images, video, audio, icons), per google_flow/00-04 specs. Sections reference exact spec-file headings. File backing is tracked in assets/registry.json (tools/register_assets.js) and enforced by tools/check_asset_files.js. Validated by tools/check_asset_manifest.js against index.html cards.",
  "howToUse": "Open google_flow/README.md. Run 00_brand_anchor.md first and save the ingredient 'desifit-modern-craftsman'. Then generate per-screen assets in the order below; 'section' points at the exact prompt block in the spec file.",
